# plotly-backed matplotlib shim doesn't emulate, so they crash at draw
# time. Replace just the plotting entry points with plotly-backed
# equivalents (official signatures, same figure pipeline as the shim).
# Palettes, themes, color utils, load_dataset etc. above remain the real
# upstream implementations. Must stay the LAST import in this file so the
# overrides win over relational/categorical/distributions/matrix.
